gin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background: 0px 0px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; min-height: 1em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background: 0px 0px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box;\"><br/></span></p></section></p><p></p><p></p><p><section><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background: 0px 0px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; min-height: 1em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background: 0px 0px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background: 0px 0px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; min-height: 1em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background: 0px 0px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">未来，万里数据库将继续坚持开放共赢的合作理念，落实自主创新精神，携手更多生态伙伴积极</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background: 0px 0px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(193, 35, 50);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background: 0px 0